8. The binary tree on odd numbers (note section 3.6)
   v_2(3m+1) >= 3 iff m = 5 mod 8, all odd m <= 400001: True (3m+1 = 0 mod 8 iff m = 7 * 3^-1 = 21 = 5 mod 8)
